licy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hGAKWDuLk2p8Gich4Q5xcib2VFebGNmX8dXNJRgWKC4DvfzYOHnAbIrxoj8TnVJ5fZ9HkhyCNJKVAxlnT3BEvWg0de6p9AMCIL1icZzlAAggOY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>推免生优惠政策</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hGAKWDuLk2ostDG7Jm5CyvFByxyldAM0XhTCJwpIoXzQaDkADeq5GsPfmjMrIm6tUldscj14FSdmamoibZeibRzdMBO4EmeB5d5ajibQADJywU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1、可跨专业报考；</span></p><p><span>2、可优先申请硕博连读或长学制，转为博士学籍后，可获得2万元博士新生奖学金；</span></p><p><span>3、同等条件下可优先录取拔尖创新人才计划。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hGAKWDuLk2p4QHYPrz6vnE3kakwcUuIArfYUQq6VIZHFS3ncUn2K7XPFQj3IHbnNZNwo1ruchHq6Gr2UxuQQOicMmyoU3O6CdZaAdBDOiasAg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hGAKWDuLk2pN7P5XyYMxnEvkx8lEEkibhsYOoetMYNa2YjSYMKB8DcqsotvcutMZGlWy3zKEBFswOIsucnvyHpa0UqmNDmoYv94JGicIEs1Pc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hGAKWDuLk2pQPrUicGaxyFwrsg7zSWubAwcIyXkownJQQTLVEWWk5y3eAVSzcAwsicJPFdib9JxGZ4Gzia5kvRbLdpbic0ob2PnGicL25O3eDhvkI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>学院预申请流程与学校相同，</span><strong><span><span>预推免报名批次与具体面试时间安排如下：</span></span></strong></p><p><span>第一批：报名截止时间：2026年8月24日11:00，面试预计2026年8月27日（星期四）下午；</span></p><p><span>第二批：报名截止时间：2026年9月7日11:00，面试预计2026年9月10日（星期四）上/下午。</span></p><p><span>第三批：报名截止时间：2026年9月15日11:00，面试预计2026年9月17日（星期四）上/下午、18日（星期五）上/下午。</span></p><p><span>*面试采取线上面试形式，请提前安排好时间，测试好设备。</span></p><p><span>*暂定2026年9月15日关闭学院预报名通道，是否再次开放，请关注学院官网或报名链接通知。</span></p><p><span>*面试场次根据学生报名情况适当调整，请及时进入沟通群。</span></p><p><span>*请拟获得推免资格的同学，</span><strong><span><span>尽快报名</span></span></strong><span>，以免错过报名时间！</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hGAKWDuLk2rhicUiawwNXOW804Jal5bp02ZDU83TAhb4c4quFfywStCIHB9LicuiaM7Xg1qJRFOwvwibHrugYYs4eVibzr6FRLhpv30ZZrSSPQSg8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>注意事项：</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1、收到报名后，学院本着按批次先申请先审核的原则安排面试，择优选拔。请学生们关注邮箱信息。</span></span></p><p><span>2、推免生最终报考录取信息以“推免服务系统”为准，推免生因填写信息虚假、错误造成的后果由本人承担。</span></p><p><span>3、对在申请过程中弄虚作假的学生，一经发现，即取消复试或录取资格，由推荐单位按学生管理规定进行相应处理。</span></p><p><span>4、拟选报国家卓越工程师学院“生物与医药”专业的学生，详细内容请至预推免系统中查看，也可直接咨询国家卓越工程师学院。</span></p><p><span>（转发“东华研招”《东华大学2027年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预报名公告》</span><span>https://yjszs.dhu.edu.cn/2026/0729/c23684a379339/page.htm</span><span>）</span></p><p><strong><span>学院联系人：崔老师</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>联系方式：cjq@dhu.edu.cn，021-67792738</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/hGAKWDuLk2qWibiaAx7WOzplRiaCJwe0pyq3XGEPq91c8PCFDAyR2UhDm5qZicwjWOz8ic1zlE2tZbJcPWmwdHeCNXvd6OjUPwooaO8IV8lOeAD4/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><span>请下载附件:</span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span></span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/EIAL7bNwGIi3kPJ-n2bqhg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>申请推荐免试研究生操作手册.docx</span></a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/EIAL7bNwGIi3kPJ-n2bqhg\"